## Households

Households represent cohabitation units or living arrangements within the extended family.

### Creating and Assigning Members

In the **Households** tab:

- Create a household with a unique descriptive name (e.g., *"Main House"*, *"City Apartment"*).
- Rename existing households.
- Assign or remove members by selecting family members from the directory.

> [!NOTE]
> A person can belong to multiple households simultaneously (e.g. shared custody or students living away from home).

### Tree Filters

In the tree view, household filter chips allow instantly spotlighting members of a given household. **Show all** restores the complete tree visibility.
